  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building management plans and capacity for the Chagos Archipelago MPA (CAMPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of running a workshop in Mauritius, which will bring together UK and international expertise to support the development of the CAMPA management plan with representatives of the relevant Mauritian government departments and other key stakeholders e.g. the Chagsossian community.</narrative>
  </description>
